# Freely distributed under the BSD open source license.
# - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
Usage: hmmerfm-exactmatch [options] <qfile> <fmfile>

Basic options:
  -h : show brief help on version and usage

Special options:
  --out <s>    : save list of hits to file <s>  ('-' writes to stdout)  [none]
  --count_only : compute just counts, not locations
  --fwd_only   : don't compute matches to the reversed sequence
